cff-version: 1.2.0
title: news-digest-agent
authors:
  - alias: jennymaeleidig
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-04"
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/jennymaeleidig/news-digest-agent"
abstract: >-
  Category-driven daily news digest: fetches curated sources
  (RSS, YouTube, JSON APIs), has an LLM pick and summarize the
  day's most relevant items, and emails the result. Forked from
  the upstream project recorded under `references` and extended
  with additional categories, a per-source User-Agent override,
  and cross-category source mappings.
references:
